Traverse → loop
Update → arr[i] = value
Length → len(arr)
2️⃣ Problem 1: Find Maximum Element 🔥
Approach:
Assume first element is max
Compare with others
arr = [10, 50, 20, 80, 30]

max_val = arr[0]

for num in arr:
    if num > max_val:
        max_val = num

print(max_val)
3️⃣ Problem 2: Reverse Array (Important)
Method 1 (Built-in)
arr = [1, 2, 3, 4]
arr.reverse()
print(arr)
Method 2 (Interview Way 🔥)
arr = [1, 2, 3, 4]

left = 0
right = len(arr) - 1

while left < right:
    arr[left], arr[right] = arr[right], arr[left]
    left += 1
    right -= 1

print(arr)
